    "updated_at": "2024-08-06T13:51:19Z",
    "body": "If we apply this rationale consistently, it seems like we should consider also changing [translate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-translate-attribute), [hidden](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-hidden-attribute), [contenteditable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#contenteditable), and [spellcheck](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-spellcheck) since they are similar.",
